# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build context trimming.
#
# The build needs: go.mod, go.sum, cmd/, internal/ (including
# internal/bpf/src/netops.bpf.c). Everything else is noise.
#
# NOTE: *.o is excluded on purpose. internal/bpf/netops.bpf.o is gitignored and
# is compiled *inside* the image (bpf-builder stage). Excluding it here
# guarantees a stale host-built object can never leak into the image and be
# picked up by //go:embed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# VCS
.git
.gitignore
.github

# Compiled artifacts (BPF objects are rebuilt in-image)
*.o
*.ll
*.a
*.so
*.test
bin/
dist/
vendor/
# stray host-built binary sitting at the repo root
/agent

# Deployment / docs / tooling that the image build does not need
chart/
docs/
Makefile
README.md
*.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore

# Editor / OS cruft
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store

# Local env
.env
.env.local
.envrc
.worktrees/
coverage.txt
*.out
